# The sources only this board's registry leaves out of a build (the pdk's tools/stub_audit.py check, kind 5; the reasons
# are its tools/stub-allow/dropped-reasons.txt). Each line: reason component source
# scdv: os/src/phescdv/scnew.cpp is the release's factory with the HAL's pitch put back (the padded VirtualBox shadow screen)
D1 scdv scnew.cpp
# openwfc_ri_display: src/phewfcdisp/openwfc_ri_displayhal.cpp drives the screen through the display HAL (no display channel driver on this board)
D16 openwfc_ri_display openwfc_ri_displaychannel.cpp
